{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"cd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-11_16-25-56-hashicorp_raft-real-run && python3 -c \\\"\nimport json\nd=json.load(open('research.json'))\nprint(json.dumps(d.get('knowledge'),indent=1)[:4000])\n\\\"\"","aggregated_output":"[\n {\n  \"id\": \"ce1a7dcb68b449448fdee06b3eb7737e-knowledge-0\",\n  \"revision\": 1,\n  \"kind\": \"behavior\",\n  \"statement\": \"Raft.timeoutNow performs an unconditional authority transition on the receiver: it clears the known leader, sets the state to Candidate, stores candidateFromLeadershipTransfer=true and responds with an empty TimeoutNowResponse. It never inspects the RPC header identity, the current configuration, or any term, and observes no election or heartbeat precondition before transitioning.\",\n  \"conditions\": \"Applies to every TimeoutNowRequest that passes checkRPCHeader, delivered to a server in any run state; the request carries only RPCHeader (ProtocolVersion, ID, Addr) and therefore cannot be evaluated for freshness.\",\n  \"source_ids\": [\n   \"s_timeoutnow_handler\",\n   \"s_timeoutnow_msg\"\n  ],\n  \"executions\": {},\n  \"operation_id\": \"ce1a7dcb68b449448fdee06b3eb7737e\",\n  \"uses\": [],\n  \"last_correction\": null\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"ce1a7dcb68b449448fdee06b3eb7737e-knowledge-1\",\n  \"revision\": 1,\n  \"kind\": \"behavior\",\n  \"statement\": \"While candidateFromLeadershipTransfer is set, runCandidate does not pre-vote: it calls electSelf directly, which increments the current term and sends RequestVote with LeadershipTransfer=true. The flag is cleared by a deferred store(false) when the candidate run ends.\",\n  \"conditions\": \"Set only by timeoutNow in the captured source; applies to a node that then enters/continues the candidate state.\",\n  \"source_ids\": [\n   \"s_prevote_gate\"\n  ],\n  \"executions\": {},\n  \"operation_id\": \"ce1a7dcb68b449448fdee06b3eb7737e\",\n  \"uses\": [],\n  \"last_correction\": null\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"ce1a7dcb68b449448fdee06b3eb7737e-knowledge-2\",\n  \"revision\": 1,\n  \"kind\": \"behavior\",\n  \"statement\": \"requestVote rejects a vote request that arrives while a different leader is known, but skips that rejection when req.LeadershipTransfer is true; the older-term rejection and the log-suffix comparison still run before a vote is granted.\",\n  \"conditions\": \"Applies to RequestVoteRequest handling on any server that has a recorded leader whose address differs from the candidate and whose protocol version carries the LeadershipTransfer flag.\",\n  \"source_ids\": [\n   \"s_vote_known_leader\",\n   \"s_vote_term_guard\"\n  ],\n  \"executions\": {},\n  \"operation_id\": \"ce1a7dcb68b449448fdee06b3eb7737e\",\n  \"uses\": [],\n  \"last_correction\": null\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"ce1a7dcb68b449448fdee06b3eb7737e-knowledge-3\",\n  \"revision\": 1,\n  \"kind\": \"behavior\",\n  \"statement\": \"The other authority-bearing RPC handlers guard their state change with the sender's term: appendEntries returns early when a.Term is below the current term and only adopts/updates term and state when the request term is greater (or the receiver is not a follower), and installSnapshot ignores a snapshot whose request term is older than the current term.\",\n  \"conditions\": \"Applies to AppendEntriesRequest and InstallSnapshotRequest processing; this is the control contrast for the TimeoutNow handler, which has no term to compare.\",\n  \"source_ids\": [\n   \"s_append_term_guard\",\n   \"s_snapshot_term_guard\"\n  ],\n  \"executions\": {},\n  \"operation_id\": \"ce1a7dcb68b449448fdee06b3eb7737e\",\n  \"uses\": [],\n  \"last_correction\": null\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"ce1a7dcb68b449448fdee06b3eb7737e-knowledge-4\",\n  \"revision\": 1,\n  \"kind\": \"behavior\",\n  \"statement\": \"The leader-side leadershipTransfer routine only issues the TimeoutNow RPC after it has driven the target's replication nextIndex past the leader's last log index, i.e. the producer establishes a caught-up target before transferring.\",\n  \"conditions\": \"Applies to the sender path invoked from leaderLoop; it is not verified by, nor visible to, the receiving timeoutNow handler.\",\n  \"source_ids\": [\n   \"s_sender_precondition\"\n  ],\n  \"executions\": {},\n  \"operation_id\": \"ce1a7dcb68b449448fdee06b3eb7737e\",\n  \"uses\": [],\n  \"last_correction\": null\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"ce1a7dcb68b449448fdee06b3eb7737e-knowledge-5\",\n  \"revision\": 1,\n  \"kind\": \"behavior\",\n  \"statement\": \"GetConfiguration does not read ma\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
